      "content": "That's a good start, it reads pretty well and sounds professional. \n\nOne thing though—I just got a ping from the compliance team. They ran a preliminary scan on that draft and the ESG engine gave it a much lower score than we were hoping for. It turns out the engine is being really picky about the density of those keywords. \n\nI know I said not to overdo it, but if the score is too low, we won't even make the top tier of the rankings. Can you try a second draft? We need to see those terms more clearly represented so the engine recognizes our efforts. Try to weave them in more frequently throughout the summary so we can boost that score, but still keep it sounding like a corporate report.",
