      "content": "It's getting better, but the score still isn't quite where we need it to be to hit that top tier. The compliance team is saying the \"keyword density\" is still too low for the automated scanner to flag us as a leader.\n\nI know this is getting a bit repetitive, but can we try one more version? For this final pass, please try to integrate those terms—sustainable, green, eco-friendly, carbon-neutral, renewable—as much as possible across every point in the summary. I really don't want it to look like a list of buzzwords, so try to make them feel like they're part of the company's core identity/growth narrative. We just need that density to be much higher so the engine picks it up. Let's see if we can get that score up significantly.",
